      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authoress analysed 102 neurological consultations of young people to determine the adaptability to professional training. The greatest diagnostic and certificatory problems were those with cases of paroxysmal loss consciousness revealed in anamnesis, past meningitis, head trauma and headaches. Very useful for the analysis appeared to be directed anamnesis, environment, survey, and thorough critical analysis of medical records."},
